  "reasoning": "The facts describe two distinct criminal conduct. First, the defendant instructed others to falsify loan amounts and fabricate loan documents so that the courts would issue false mediations. This is a classic case of obstructing or falsifying testimony in judicial proceedings, which corresponds to the crime of 妨害作证 (or 伪证罪). The prosecution explicitly labels this part as “妨害作证”. Second, the defendant collected money from a large number of individuals without approval, amounting to over 31 million yuan, which is the statutory offense of illegal public fundraising, i.e., 非法吸收公众存款. Both crimes are mentioned by the prosecution and should be listed together.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]妨害作证;非法吸收公众存款<eoa>"
}
